ustep S A df dc CD G GC n hcd hdf hsk kt co lo (fqclos g env) (umb st) Γ C d e s W hu hk h x he = Empty-rec (false≢true hk)
ustep S A df dc CD G GC n hcd hdf hsk kt co lo (fqapp f as) (umb st) Γ C d e s W hu hk h x he = Empty-rec (false≢true hk)
