ustep S A df dc CD G GC n hcd hdf hsk kt co lo (fqv k) m Γ C d e s W hu hk h x he = Empty-rec (false≢true hu)
ustep S A df dc CD G GC n hcd hdf hsk kt co lo (fqprim p as) m Γ C d e s W hu hk h x he = Empty-rec (false≢true hu)
